InvoiceShelf on FenrirOS
========================

Code in /usr/share/invoiceshelf (web root: public/). Its .env is
/etc/invoiceshelf/env; storage/ and bootstrap/cache live in
/var/lib/invoiceshelf (links from the code directory). PHP runs as _php.
InvoiceShelf needs PHP 8.4.1 or newer.

1. Database: SQLite needs nothing more (keep the file under
   /var/lib/invoiceshelf, e.g. DB_DATABASE=/var/lib/invoiceshelf/storage/database.sqlite);
   for MariaDB or PostgreSQL create a database and a user for it.
2. cp /usr/share/invoiceshelf/.env.example /etc/invoiceshelf/env
   chown _php:_php /etc/invoiceshelf/env
   set APP_URL and SANCTUM_STATEFUL_DOMAIN (the site's host name), then
     su -s /bin/sh _php -c 'php /usr/share/invoiceshelf/artisan key:generate --force'
3. nginx: /usr/share/doc/invoiceshelf/nginx-invoiceshelf.conf (and,
   optionally, the php-fpm pool php-fpm-invoiceshelf.conf); enable php-fpm
   and nginx (dinitctl enable php-fpm nginx), then open https://<host>/ and
   follow the installation wizard (database, the first company and user).
4. Scheduler: cp /usr/share/doc/invoiceshelf/invoiceshelf.cron
   /etc/cron.d/invoiceshelf and dinitctl enable crond.
